# Publish ONLY the game. Ignore everything else in this working folder
# (the big PDFs/zips, backups, slide images, music, and local dev-only scripts
#  like serve.ps1 / the launcher / .claude all stay off the public site).
/*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!title.html
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!ROADMAP.md
# PWA app files — installable/offline support (see title.html head + sw.js)
!manifest.webmanifest
!sw.js
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!apple-touch-icon.png
# Bundled ad-free audio tracks (menu theme, etc.) referenced directly by title.html
!audio/
!audio/the_fire_rages.m4a

# Levy — the tModLoader mod lives in its own box (levy-mod/), separate from the game site
!levy-mod/
levy-mod/Levy/obj/
levy-mod/Levy/bin/
levy-mod/Levy/.vs/

# review workflow script (dev-only, not part of the mod)
levy-mod/tools/review2.js
